    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>BouleMan \u2013 A Game for the Whole Family!</strong> \ud83c\udf1f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the colorful and fun world of <strong>BouleMan</strong>, a game designed for players of all ages. Whether you're a curious child, a parent looking for a relaxing break, or a grandparent reminiscing about the simplicity of classic games, <strong>BouleMan</strong> is made for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to its <strong>multi-save system</strong>, BouleMan allows <strong>up to 5 players to create and keep their own personal save file</strong>. Every family member can enjoy their own adventure at their own pace\u2014no progress lost, no game overwritten. It\u2019s the perfect setup for a shared gaming experience where everyone has their own space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BouleMan</strong> offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Easy-to-learn, accessible gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 A family-friendly and inclusive experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe 5 independent save slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 A charming, colorful world full of lighthearted fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Gradual challenges that suit all age groups</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play for 10 minutes or 2 hours, BouleMan delivers moments of pure, carefree fun. It's ideal for solo play, turn-based family sessions, or just enjoying the game together from the couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So\u2026 <strong>who will be the top BouleMan in your household?</strong> Time to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402740/extras/b276783c6e58313ae8b56818ec0377c7.avif?t=1751706108\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>BouleMan \u2013 A Game for the Whole Family!</strong> \ud83c\udf1f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the colorful and fun world of <strong>BouleMan</strong>, a game designed for players of all ages. Whether you're a curious child, a parent looking for a relaxing break, or a grandparent reminiscing about the simplicity of classic games, <strong>BouleMan</strong> is made for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to its <strong>multi-save system</strong>, BouleMan allows <strong>up to 5 players to create and keep their own personal save file</strong>. Every family member can enjoy their own adventure at their own pace\u2014no progress lost, no game overwritten. It\u2019s the perfect setup for a shared gaming experience where everyone has their own space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BouleMan</strong> offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Easy-to-learn, accessible gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 A family-friendly and inclusive experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe 5 independent save slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 A charming, colorful world full of lighthearted fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Gradual challenges that suit all age groups</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play for 10 minutes or 2 hours, BouleMan delivers moments of pure, carefree fun. It's ideal for solo play, turn-based family sessions, or just enjoying the game together from the couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So\u2026 <strong>who will be the top BouleMan in your household?</strong> Time to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402740/extras/b276783c6e58313ae8b56818ec0377c7.avif?t=1751706108\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
